  body
    h1 Welcome to the Web 3 Developer Bootcamp!

    p Hey #{firstName}!

    p We’re thrilled to have you join us for the Web 3 Developer Bootcamp! By signing up, you’re about to dive into the world of Web 3 and blockchain development.

    h2 What to Expect

    p Over the next few weeks, you’ll be learning directly from industry experts about essential Web 3 skills—from integrating smart contract in your Frontends to writing your own smart contracts.

    p This bootcamp is designed to help you build skills and confidence, as a web 3 developer.

    h3 Join Our WhatsApp Channel!
    p #[a(href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/IO850f4zkHTFoszE93wLni") Click here to join and stay updated!]

    h2 Get Ready

    p To make the most of this experience, we recommend bringing:

    ul
      li A notepad or digital document for taking notes.
      li Any previous work or projects you’d like to share or build on.
      li An open mind—be ready to collaborate, learn, and grow!

    h2 Don’t Forget

    p Add this bootcamp to your calendar! Each session will be packed with insights you won’t want to miss. And if you know friends or colleagues who’d benefit, feel free to share our registration link.

    p We’re excited to see you grow in your journey as a Web 3 Dev, and we can’t wait to see the skills and projects you’ll be working on!

    p Regards,
    p The BlockchainUNN Team
